This blog is free to read, ad-free, and will stay that way. If a post saved you time or you just want to help keep it going, here are the ways to do that.

## Ko-fi

The simplest way to support the blog directly is a one-off or recurring contribution on [Ko-fi](https://ko-fi.com/serhiichernenko).

